WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:02.120
Koliko je ova narukvica?

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:03.780
Narukvica je hiljadu.

3
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.780
A može neki popust?

4
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.660
A pa zavisi koliko komada planirate da uzmete.

5
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.360
Pa jedno.

6
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.260
Pa onda nema popusta.

7
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.460
Zašto?

8
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.460
Pa zato što je cena jedne narukvice hiljadu.

9
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:19.720
Evo, može za 700.

10
00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:23.700
Stvarno, nije moja roba. Ja sam samo radnik ovde.

11
00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:24.780
Ne mogu.

12
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.860
750 i to je to.

13
00:00:27.820 --> 00:00:29.900
Žao mi je, stvarno ne mogu.

14
00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:32.880
Ma, 800 ni dinar više, tako sam rekla.

15
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.440
1300, molim.

16
00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:39.940
Pa, kako sad to?

17
00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:41.660
Eto tako, 1300.

18
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.780
Pa, rekli ste da nije vaša roba, vi ste samo radnik.

19
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:48.960
Dobro, shvatila sam.

20
00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.020
Prava cena narukvice je 1000.

21
00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.860
1000 je narukvica i to je to, razumem.
